{"candidateAnswer":"Do your homework, find the right professionals, get your paperwork in order, and prepare yourself emotionally","evidence":"[D17:7 | 10:31 am on 13 October, 2023] Caroline: Yep! Do your research and find an adoption agency or lawyer. They'll help with the process and provide all the info. Gather documents like references, financial info and medical checks. Don't forget to prepare emotionally, since the wait can be hard. It's all worth it in the end though.","itemId":"urn:uuid:9c15353b-4a97-55fc-929e-9755e6eaad6d","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:9b439f9610c77aafd2bc4727cd2e83653efde80cca0dbcc9f0c29e29da95a600","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What advice does Caroline give for getting started with adoption?","referenceAnswer":"Do research, find an adoption agency or lawyer, gather necessary documents, and prepare emotionally.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"9b439f9610c77aafd2bc4727cd2e83653efde80cca0dbcc9f0c29e29da95a600"}}]}